                <div class="story-highlight">
                    <p>"After just 6 weeks of recovery, I was walking my daughter down the aisle without any pain. Something I never thought possible."</p>
                </div>
                <p class="story-excerpt">James chose Xiehe Hospital in Beijing, where he received a full knee replacement using state-of-the-art robotic-assisted surgery. The entire process, including 3 weeks of rehabilitation at the hospital, was completed for just £6,000.</p>
                <div class="savings">Saved £16,000</div>
