                <div class="story-highlight">
                    <p>"Fuwai Hospital's cardiac department is unparalleled. The surgeon had performed over 5,000 bypass surgeries. I couldn't have received better care anywhere in the world."</p>
                </div>
                <p class="story-excerpt">At Beijing Fuwai Hospital, Robert received a triple bypass from Dr. Wang, a surgeon with 30 years of experience and training from Cleveland Clinic. Total cost: $10,000 CAD, including airport transfers and a 4-week recovery stay.</p>
                <div class="savings">Saved $85,000 CAD</div>
                <a href="robert-chen.html" class="read-more">Read Full Story →</a>
