                    <h4>How do I know my medical records will be handled confidentially?</h4>
                    <p>All partner hospitals comply with international patient privacy standards. Your medical records are protected under Chinese healthcare privacy laws and can be transmitted securely through encrypted systems. You're in control of who sees your information.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <h4>Can I bring a companion with me?</h4>
                    <p>Absolutely. Most medical tourism packages allow you to bring family members or companions. The companion's travel and accommodation costs are usually separate, but hospitals can recommend nearby accommodation suitable for extended stays.</p>
